MOD-WIFI — Wi-Fi sensing node (ESP32-C3 + ESPectre + AHT20/BMP280 + Hitachi IR)
Copyright (c) 2026 MOD-WIFI contributors

This repository contains parts under different licenses:

  firmware/                         GPL-3.0-only      (LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt)
  cad/, wiring/, bom/               CERN-OHL-P-2.0    (LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt)
  self-drawn part graphics in
  wiring/ (board, module, NPN,
  LED, receiver artwork)            CC0-1.0           (LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt)
  docs/                             see docs/licensing.md

Why GPL-3.0-only for the firmware: it is built with ESPHome's `espectre`
component and the ESPectre SDK (francescopace/espectre, GPL-3.0-only), and with
ESPHome's C++ runtime (GPLv3). A distributed firmware image is a single combined
work and must be licensed as a whole under GPLv3, with complete corresponding
source. The firmware configuration in this repository is therefore released
under GPL-3.0-only, matching upstream.

Each file may also carry an SPDX-License-Identifier header; where present, it
applies to that file. Third-party notices: NOTICE.md.

授權總則（中文）：韌體 GPL-3.0-only；硬體（外殼、接線、BOM）CERN-OHL-P-2.0；
自繪元件圖 CC0-1.0。理由見 docs/licensing.md。
